# Vendored shadcn output. eslint already excludes it as upstream's to own;
# prettier must match, or every `shadcn add` re-add churns the diff on files
# we do not edit. shadcn emits semicolons and double quotes.
# NOTE the trailing `*`, not a trailing `/`: gitignore syntax cannot re-include
# a file whose parent DIRECTORY is excluded, so `src/components/ui/` would make
# the negations below silently do nothing. Excluding the entries instead of the
# directory is what makes them work.
src/components/ui/*
# ...except the files in there that are OURS, not upstream's. sonner.tsx is
# hand-written (the registry one imports next-themes) and so is form.tsx (the
# registry one is built on react-hook-form). Without these negations our own
# code would sit in the directory unformatted and unchecked.
!src/components/ui/sonner.tsx
!src/components/ui/form.tsx

